		list-style: none;
		padding: 0;
		margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
		border-top: 1px solid #e6e2da;
	}
	.refs li {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 2rem 1fr;
		gap: 0.75rem;
		padding: 0.85rem 0;
